paperweight-grub (0.1.3-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Add all four Catppuccin variant themes: macchiato.txt, latte.txt,
    frappe.txt, mocha.txt. Each applies per-variant palette for background,
    item text, selected highlight (mauve), progress bar, and timeout label.
  * Add paperweight-grub-theme helper: copies selected variant to theme.txt
    and runs update-grub. Usage: sudo paperweight-grub-theme <variant>.
  * theme.txt: improved layout — narrower 60% menu (was 70%), thinner 4px
    progress bar (was 16px), header 'paperweight' label at 8% top in overlay0.
    Defaults to Macchiato on fresh install.
  * debian/install: add all four variant .txt files and usr/bin helper.
  * debian/control: update description to mention all four variants and the
    paperweight-grub-theme switcher.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:01 +0000

